                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.84/57: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister Resident in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-04">May 4, 1936</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>182. Your 282, May 4, 3 p.m. Can you not communicate with British Legation by
                    radio?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
